# Xv6 System Calls Lab 🐧

This lab is part of my journey through **MIT 6.1810 (Operating Systems)**, where I added new system calls to **xv6**. The goal was to implement a **trace** system call to help debug other labs and exploit a security vulnerability in xv6 to understand how system call bugs can break isolation boundaries.

---

